  "rulings": [
    {
      "comment": "If an attacking creature loses haste, perhaps because Fervor leaves the battlefield after attackers have been declared, it won't be removed from combat.",
      "oracle_id": "8e0cea9c-3110-4728-9378-76849e33bb90",
      "published_at": "2012-07-01",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The ability can apply to alternative costs to cast a spell.",
      "oracle_id": "2894efc6-ee78-4353-b98a-8005a2451139",
      "published_at": "2015-02-25",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If there are any additional costs to cast a spell, apply those before applying Hardened Berserker and any other cost reductions.",
      "oracle_id": "2894efc6-ee78-4353-b98a-8005a2451139",
      "published_at": "2015-02-25",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Hardened Berserker can\u2019t reduce the colored mana requirement of a spell you cast.",
      "oracle_id": "2894efc6-ee78-4353-b98a-8005a2451139",
      "published_at": "2015-02-25",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you're paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Kaza's activated ability). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.",
      "oracle_id": "0b8517c0-0441-4fd9-99ec-2274e57c3cb6",
      "published_at": "2020-09-25",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Kaza's cost reduction can reduce only generic mana in a spell's cost. It can't reduce colored mana requirements.",
      "oracle_id": "0b8517c0-0441-4fd9-99ec-2274e57c3cb6",
      "published_at": "2020-09-25",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\u2019re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Maelstrom Muse\u2019s triggered ability). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.",
      "oracle_id": "30b03dda-409f-4615-b392-477d66eb49f4",
      "published_at": "2021-04-16",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Maelstrom Muse\u2019s cost reduction can reduce only generic mana in a spell\u2019s total cost. It can\u2019t reduce colored mana requirements.",
      "oracle_id": "30b03dda-409f-4615-b392-477d66eb49f4",
      "published_at": "2021-04-16",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.",
      "oracle_id": "fa85c5a2-8e83-4624-a35a-a0bbf17ecbb4",
      "published_at": "2024-11-08",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you're paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.",
      "oracle_id": "fa85c5a2-8e83-4624-a35a-a0bbf17ecbb4",
      "published_at": "2024-11-08",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card's type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.",
      "oracle_id": "fa85c5a2-8e83-4624-a35a-a0bbf17ecbb4",
      "published_at": "2024-11-08",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it's legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.",
      "oracle_id": "fa85c5a2-8e83-4624-a35a-a0bbf17ecbb4",
      "published_at": "2024-11-08",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "\"Flashback [cost]\" means \"You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost\" and \"If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.\"",
      "oracle_id": "fa85c5a2-8e83-4624-a35a-a0bbf17ecbb4",
      "published_at": "2024-11-08",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.",
      "oracle_id": "fa85c5a2-8e83-4624-a35a-a0bbf17ecbb4",
      "published_at": "2024-11-08",
      "source": "wotc"
    }
